# Capacitor (P5v, docs/p5v-bw80-video/BW80_VIDEO_DESIGN.md §2): U1's first inverter drives A;
# C1 (47p) couples A to B, which R1 (470) pulls down: each rise of A is a 22 ns high pulse on B,
# the second inverter's input.

part J1 POWER
part U1 74LS04
part C1 C value=47p
part R1 R value=470

net A   U1.1Y C1.1
net B   C1.2 R1.1 U1.2A
net B_N U1.2Y
net GND R1.2 U1.1A U1.3A U1.4A U1.5A U1.6A
